 anfit               n     flaganfit    flag for using fitted (a,n) nuclear model parameters
 gamgamfit           n    flaggamgamfit flag for using fitted Gamma_gamma nuclear model parameters
 macsfit             n     flagmacsfit  flag for using fitted MACS nuclear model parameters
